Hi Matthew,

Thanks for your time so far. To be clear, though, I would like to remain in
the loop, even if Heather is your primary contact. You can reach me at this
email or on my mobile.

I'm happy for you to discuss matters arising verbally with Heather alone if
that makes things simpler. However, I'd be grateful if you could include me
in any email correspondence. Any signatures or authorisation would have to
remain joint. I'm sure we can make that work without too much extra
overhead.

All the best,

Rupert

